    "ruleType": "weapon-ability",
    "group": "Core",
    "summary": "Whenever an attack by a **[[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits)** weapon scores a critical hit against a target unit that is not a **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** unit, you can have that attack wound the target automatically. If you do, the attack skips its [Wound roll](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls), so it cannot score a critical wound or trigger rules such as **[[DEVASTATING WOUNDS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/devastating-wounds)**.",
